    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></TD>
    <TD COLSPAN="2" STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><I>Except as set forth below in this Item 4, the undersigned
    is not the beneficial or registered owner of any securities of the Company other than the securities issuable pursuant to the Purchase
    Agreement.</I></FONT></TD></TR>
